  "plain": "A podcast host, Jesse Michels, says that in 2025 he contacted his friend Ben Lam at Colossal Biosciences, a genetics company, about mummified bodies from Peru that have three fingers on each hand. According to Michels, the plan was to run ancient DNA tests on them, with the geneticist George Church also named. The tests could help settle what these strange bodies really are."
